            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abarira Aroni n’abana biwe Eleyazari na Itamari, ati Ntimuhamburure imishatsi yanyu, canke ngo mutantamure impuzu zanyu, kugira ngo ntimupfe, kand’ Uhoraho ntarakire ikoraniro ryose; ariko bene wanyu, ab’ inzu yose ya Isirayeli, abe ari bo baborogeshwa n’ umuriro Uhoraho arekuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
