        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abarira Aroni n’abana biwe basigaye, Eleyazari na Itamari, ati Ni mujane ivyasigaye kuri rya shikanwa ry’ifu ryo mu mashikanwa yashikaniwe Uhoraho agatōngōrwa n’umuriro, mubirīre i ruhande y’igicaniro bitarimw’ umwambiro: kukw ar’ ivyera cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mubirīre ahantu hēra, kukw ar’ umuturi wawe n’uw’ abana bawe, wo ku mashikanwa ashikaniwe Uhoraho agatōngōrwa n’umuriro; kuk’ ukw ari ko nabariwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
