        },
        {
          "text": "Na ya nkoro yashikanishijwe kuzunguzwa, na ca gikenye c’ukuguru cagerewe abaherezi, mubirīre ahantu hadahumanye, mwe n’abahungu bawe n’abakobga bawe; kukw ari vyo wagerewe ngo bibe umuturi wawe, n’uw’ abahungu bawe, wo ku bimazi vy’ishimwe Abisirayeli bashikanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igikenye c’ukuguru kigerewe abaherezi bo n’inkoro yo kuzunguzwa, baze bahore babizanana n’ishikanwa ry’ibinure ryo gutōngōrwa n’umuriro, ngo babizunguze, bibe ishikanwa rizungurijwe imbere y’Uhoraho: ivyo bizoba ivyawe n’ivy’ abana bawe, bibe umuturi wanyu w’intahava, nk’uk’ Uhoraho yageze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
